J1 / J1a originally by James Bowman (swapforth), BSD-3-Clause.
`j1.v`, `stack2.v`, and `uart.v` are vendored from that project.
`swapforth/` is the J1a Forth (`cross.fs`, `nuc.fs`, `swapforth.fs`, `common/core.fs`, `common/core-ext.fs`) with its BSD text in `swapforth/LICENSE`.
`j1b.v`, `stack.v`, and `common.h` are the 32-bit core from AFCK_J1B_FORTH `original/j1b/verilog`. `swapforth/j1b/` is that tree's cross (`cross.fs`, `basewords.fs`, `nuc.fs`, `swapforth.fs`); the same BSD text is in `swapforth/j1b/LICENSE`.
`j1_wrap.v` loads `firmware.hex` and runs the 16-bit core.
